{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50503","headline":"嵩南山九里旧鹊村作 · 宋之问","name":"嵩南山九里旧鹊村作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"弊庐接箕颍，北望嵩山隅。\n兹岭雄且秀，彩翠横天衢。\n家世事灵岳，岩栖安敢渝。\n从俗因迹化，归静知心愚。\n上违先人训，下怜菲薄躯。\n自问何功业，谬与贤俊俱。\n执覊翊龙羽，秉笔游鸿都。\n尸禄负诸己，日使田园芜。\n常恐白云意，溘尽黄埃涂。\n妙年负恩德，欲去何踟蹰？\n明主本尚道，黄屋均蓬壶。\n饮惠可冥分，归事烧金鑪。\n（此诗见《永乐大典》卷三五八○「九真」「村」字「旧鹊村」条。\n〖五函五十册〗）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50503.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50503","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}